{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55818","headline":"送士濂弟之京 · 慧忠","name":"送士濂弟之京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行色翩翩入帝都，壮怀此去莫踌躇。\n昔曾故国登高第，今向新朝再上书。\n汝负才猷堪济世，我惭衰朽合闲居。\n[鴒]（鸽）原今日常相望，衣锦还乡常有余。\n（见光绪廿六年刊翁昭泰纂《浦城县志》卷三九引《章氏会谱》。\n）（按：题下原注：「士濂，得象祖。\n」宋祁《景文集》卷五九《文宪章公墓志铭》：「曾祖仁嵩，仕李昪爲驾部郎中。\n……祖士廉，汀州宁化令。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}